WEBVTT

01:44.640 --> 01:47.640
That day, Old Madam Wu gave me a dagger.

01:49.229 --> 01:51.229
She said it was a gift from Mr. Zhang.

01:51.710 --> 01:52.710
But I accidentally discovered

01:52.710 --> 01:54.509
this crystal inside the dagger.

01:55.840 --> 01:58.039
This crystal is the Hero Command Token.

01:58.870 --> 02:00.000
But I've been unable

02:00.710 --> 02:03.440
to figure out
the mystery of the Voidheart Codex.

02:04.480 --> 02:06.940
We've finally found
the Hero Command Token,

02:06.950 --> 02:11.009
but it turns out the token actually
doesn't contain the Voidheart Codex.

02:13.710 --> 02:14.910
These 3 fingerprints

02:15.430 --> 02:17.750
belong to Tianzheng from Shaolin Sect,

02:18.280 --> 02:19.710
Taichan from Wudang Sect,

02:19.710 --> 02:21.240
and Zhichen from Emei Sect.

02:21.240 --> 02:22.590
The only one still alive

02:23.280 --> 02:24.740
is Zhichen from Emei Sect.

02:25.710 --> 02:26.870
If we go to Emei Sect,

02:28.030 --> 02:28.870
even if we don't find

02:28.870 --> 02:30.930
the Voidheart Codex's whereabouts,

02:30.960 --> 02:34.190
we might find clues about Crazy Yan.

02:36.910 --> 02:39.840
I've always felt that Crazy Yan

02:40.870 --> 02:42.730
might be able to cure your father.

02:44.240 --> 02:44.870
Besides,

02:45.520 --> 02:47.050
I once promised Old Madam Wu

02:48.560 --> 02:50.620
that I would find Crazy Yan's sister.

03:08.000 --> 03:08.800
What's wrong?

03:09.630 --> 03:10.490
It's Tang Song.

03:11.590 --> 03:12.990
When I fell into the trap,

03:13.560 --> 03:14.960
I sent a bee to follow him.

03:16.120 --> 03:18.050
He's heading to Insect Valley now.

03:19.870 --> 03:21.750
Is there something unusual about that?

03:21.750 --> 03:23.360
The once-every-five-years Night of Yin-Hai

03:23.360 --> 03:24.430
is about to begin.

03:24.870 --> 03:26.270
It's exactly at this time

03:26.680 --> 03:30.010
that other branch families
can challenge the first branch—

03:30.910 --> 03:32.110
regardless of life or death.

03:32.110 --> 03:34.910
The winner will become
the new leader of Tang Sect.

03:35.190 --> 03:38.250
But this time, the place
chosen for the Night of Yin-Hai

03:38.840 --> 03:40.370
is actually Insect Valley.

03:41.079 --> 03:42.750
That's what I find suspicious.

03:42.750 --> 03:44.950
That is the forbidden area of Tang Sect.

03:45.000 --> 03:47.060
It's been a few years since it opened.

03:48.590 --> 03:49.850
The Death Beetle King.

03:50.470 --> 03:53.079
The rejuvenation place for it
is Insect Valley.

03:53.079 --> 03:57.430
So he wants to use the Night of Yin-Hai
to open Insect Valley.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.440
Big Brother,

04:02.590 --> 04:04.400
I heard you're going to see Sword King.

04:04.400 --> 04:05.130
Big Brother,

04:05.240 --> 04:07.280
we still haven't found that whatever king.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.150
The Failure King.

04:08.150 --> 04:09.960
-Right, the Failure King.
-Although we haven't found it,

04:09.960 --> 04:11.630
I will get

04:11.630 --> 04:13.360
some evidence from Sword King.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.190
What do you need us to do?

04:15.190 --> 04:15.960
Don't worry.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.990
I'll get Sword King
to leak some information to me.

04:19.269 --> 04:22.130
You, under the pretext
of suppressing Liu Suifeng,

04:22.270 --> 04:25.200
will actually weaken
the Power Gang's strongholds.

04:25.950 --> 04:27.080
Count us sisters in.

04:27.560 --> 04:30.270
The Power Gang harmed our father.
They're the Qu family's sworn enemies.

04:30.270 --> 04:31.510
Now we are

04:31.510 --> 04:33.040
also members
of the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.920
Big Brother,
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood

04:34.920 --> 04:36.850
is growing stronger and stronger.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.200
That's because of all of you.

04:40.390 --> 04:42.190
In the future,
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood

04:42.190 --> 04:44.450
must restore peace to the martial world.

04:44.830 --> 04:47.630
But everyone must remain vigilant.

04:48.750 --> 04:51.560
So we must strengthen our martial skills.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.390
-Okay.
-Okay.

05:56.720 --> 05:58.980
Guys, please open Insect Valley's gate.

05:59.240 --> 06:01.000
Tonight is the Night of Yin-Hai.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.330
We'll guard this place.

06:02.680 --> 06:05.190
Insect Valley has always been
under my supervision.

06:05.190 --> 06:06.680
Why the change of personnel?

06:06.680 --> 06:08.810
You should ask the 5 elders about that.

06:12.720 --> 06:14.180
Greetings, Elder Chijie.

06:14.750 --> 06:17.680
Greetings to the 4 elders
of Success, Failure, Gain, Loss.

06:17.680 --> 06:21.140
This time's Night of Yin-Hai
will take place in Insect Valley.

06:21.270 --> 06:24.000
We will replace
all the guards of Insect Valley

06:24.160 --> 06:26.800
with convicts sentenced to penal servitude
in the Avici Tower.

06:26.800 --> 06:30.260
This ensures impartiality and fairness
toward all branches.

06:32.430 --> 06:33.230
Open the gate.

06:50.830 --> 06:52.750
Take your men and leave.

06:53.270 --> 06:53.800
Yes.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.120
Thank you, elders.

07:00.720 --> 07:01.780
Please go and rest.

07:22.190 --> 07:22.800
Master.

07:23.830 --> 07:24.750
The guards here

07:25.000 --> 07:26.830
have all been replaced with our men.

07:26.830 --> 07:28.510
Now you can
go to the back valley without worry

07:28.510 --> 07:29.630
to attend to your matters.

07:29.630 --> 07:30.120
No rush.

07:30.600 --> 07:32.860
Is there something still troubling you?

07:33.920 --> 07:35.310
If I were Xiao Qiushui,

07:36.390 --> 07:39.050
I would definitely
come to Insect Valley today.

07:41.040 --> 07:42.640
Guard this place carefully.

07:43.240 --> 07:43.800
Yes.

07:57.000 --> 07:59.600
Mr. Xiao,
have you found the Death Beetle King?

08:00.560 --> 08:01.160
No.

08:03.560 --> 08:06.220
Why come to me
without bringing what I asked for?

08:07.870 --> 08:08.530
I'm here...

08:11.040 --> 08:11.920
to save you.

08:23.830 --> 08:26.160
The molted shell of the Death Beetle King?

08:26.190 --> 08:28.320
Its 8 patterns are about to reduce to 7.

08:29.720 --> 08:30.360
Correct.

08:31.720 --> 08:32.470
Now,

08:33.320 --> 08:35.870
the Power Gang
uses Death Beetles in the Misery Pills

08:35.870 --> 08:36.929
to control others.

08:37.440 --> 08:38.700
This Death Beetle King

08:39.909 --> 08:40.770
is about to molt

08:41.480 --> 08:43.409
and urgently needs to rejuvenate.

08:44.320 --> 08:46.120
What does this have to do with me?

08:48.240 --> 08:49.640
Such an important thing—

08:50.240 --> 08:52.630
Chief Li didn't entrust it to you.

08:53.440 --> 08:56.750
Instead, he gave this most trusted object

08:57.240 --> 08:58.360
to someone else.

08:59.600 --> 09:00.550
Think about it.

09:01.360 --> 09:04.270
If Liu Suifeng really succeeds
in rejuvenating the Death Beetle King,

09:04.270 --> 09:06.270
he will become the new Blood Master.

09:06.480 --> 09:09.360
The Misery Pills control so many people,

09:10.080 --> 09:12.010
including you, Sword King, right?

09:16.600 --> 09:17.800
You know everything?

09:20.870 --> 09:23.070
Above the Eight Kings of the Power Gang,

09:23.550 --> 09:25.750
all are controlled by the Misery Pills.

09:26.790 --> 09:27.790
The purpose

09:28.480 --> 09:31.140
is to prevent everyone
from killing each other.

09:31.360 --> 09:34.720
If someone
truly becomes the new Blood Master

09:35.200 --> 09:38.060
and breaks free
from the control of the Misery Pill,

09:38.270 --> 09:38.870
guess

09:39.870 --> 09:41.390
what would happen to those

09:42.080 --> 09:43.540
he bears a grudge against.

09:50.870 --> 09:52.200
What do you intend to do?

09:55.550 --> 09:56.840
If Liu Suifeng

09:57.510 --> 10:01.200
accidentally kills one of the Eight Kings,

10:02.360 --> 10:04.870
the Misery Pill inside him
will be activated.

10:04.870 --> 10:06.600
Then he'll be severely weakened.

10:06.600 --> 10:07.550
At that time,

10:08.510 --> 10:10.030
both you and I can kill him.

10:18.960 --> 10:20.620
Since we are to work together,

10:21.270 --> 10:22.630
you must tell me

10:22.630 --> 10:24.290
where his forces are located,

10:24.510 --> 10:25.960
so I can arrange

10:27.840 --> 10:30.270
to have them destroyed.

10:30.910 --> 10:31.630
Then,

10:35.480 --> 10:36.200
you and I...

10:43.480 --> 10:44.240
Nice tea.

10:55.000 --> 10:56.270
The entrance is right here.

10:56.270 --> 10:56.720
Okay.

11:03.480 --> 11:04.080
Wait.

11:05.790 --> 11:08.450
Who authorized you
to guard the forbidden area?

11:08.870 --> 11:11.070
It was the elders' decision, of course.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.330
On the Night of Yin-Hai,

11:15.440 --> 11:17.700
the current Master hasn't even shown up.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.080
There's no need

11:21.390 --> 11:23.670
for my father to deal with you personally.

11:23.670 --> 11:24.730
Let us through now!

11:30.360 --> 11:32.760
Who gave you the nerve
to act so recklessly?

11:33.840 --> 11:35.240
If you're not convinced,

11:36.030 --> 11:38.150
why don't we have a match right now?

11:38.790 --> 11:39.450
Bring it on.

11:43.320 --> 11:45.030
Old Madam Tang has arrived!

11:53.320 --> 11:56.520
-Greetings, Old Madam Tang.
-Greetings, Old Madam Tang.

12:05.550 --> 12:08.010
Coming this far
is already annoying enough.

12:08.320 --> 12:10.720
Success, Failure, Gain, Loss, and Chijie,

12:11.080 --> 12:12.840
The location for this Night of Yin-Hai—

12:12.840 --> 12:14.270
was it your idea?

12:14.720 --> 12:15.380
-Yes.
-Yes.

12:17.360 --> 12:20.870
Never mind. Then let it begin quickly.

13:15.630 --> 13:16.550
What's going on?

13:16.550 --> 13:17.610
Set the sedan down.

13:20.360 --> 13:21.080
What's going on?

13:21.080 --> 13:22.240
A stone came out of nowhere

13:22.240 --> 13:23.320
and injured my foot.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.320
I startled Old Madam Tang.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.000
Please forgive me!

13:25.000 --> 13:27.330
Enough. Have someone else take his place.

13:27.390 --> 13:27.910
Yes.

13:32.030 --> 13:32.510
You.

13:34.120 --> 13:34.980
Take his place.

13:47.030 --> 13:48.000
Lift the sedan!

13:56.870 --> 13:57.630
Set it down!

14:12.440 --> 14:14.360
The night is deep and the dew is heavy.

14:14.360 --> 14:16.030
This Night of Yin-Hai

14:16.550 --> 14:17.950
will likely be a long one.

14:26.200 --> 14:29.400
-Greetings, Old Madam Tang.
-Greetings, Old Madam Tang.

14:40.270 --> 14:41.730
Xiao Qiushui has entered.

14:45.750 --> 14:47.950
Don't let anyone enter the back valley.

14:48.240 --> 14:48.910
-Yes.
-Yes.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.150
Tang Song

15:19.320 --> 15:20.580
played so many tricks.

15:21.080 --> 15:23.550
I suspect
there's a greater plot behind him.

15:24.670 --> 15:26.670
You'll go to the Scorpion Platform.

15:27.360 --> 15:28.960
Be careful with everything.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.910
The Night of Yin-Hai
comes once every 5 years.

15:32.910 --> 15:34.970
After all these years, I'm used to it.

15:35.320 --> 15:37.520
If I can't even handle such a situation,

15:37.840 --> 15:40.120
how can I call myself
a member of the first branch?

15:40.120 --> 15:41.870
Find a way to get to the back valley.

15:41.870 --> 15:43.000
Leave the rest to me.

15:59.000 --> 15:59.670
Tang Song,

16:00.440 --> 16:03.040
it seems
the other branches won't be coming up.

16:03.120 --> 16:06.240
It'll just be our first branch
against your third branch.

16:06.240 --> 16:07.570
Let's have a good fight.

16:10.550 --> 16:11.360
Tang Qing,

16:11.750 --> 16:14.720
aren't those two
experts from the third branch?

16:15.510 --> 16:18.370
Why aren't they coming up
to the Scorpion Platform?

16:24.240 --> 16:25.030
Tang Song,

16:26.390 --> 16:29.150
you guys still won't come up
to the Scorpion Platform.

16:29.150 --> 16:32.480
What tricks are you trying to play
in front of Old Madam Tang?

16:34.320 --> 16:35.750
Stop wasting time.

16:36.270 --> 16:38.270
Tang Qing, you go first.

16:38.670 --> 16:41.070
Let's finish early
so we can go back to rest.

16:41.600 --> 16:42.080
Yes.

16:47.270 --> 16:49.480
Fang, you're really eager to fight me.

16:49.750 --> 16:50.750
Aren't you eager?

16:51.320 --> 16:52.180
Make your move.

17:05.440 --> 17:06.440
Deputy Chief Liu.

17:09.790 --> 17:13.270
This is the perfect place
to nurture the Death Beetle King.

17:14.000 --> 17:17.200
The miasma is thick,
and fungi and grass grow abundantly.

17:17.550 --> 17:18.270
Excellent.

17:20.069 --> 17:21.670
The moonlight has appeared.

17:21.680 --> 17:22.680
I shall begin now.

18:03.640 --> 18:05.170
Guard the Beetle King well.

18:05.240 --> 18:07.440
I'll eliminate any potential threats!

18:21.590 --> 18:22.250
Ghost King.

18:23.830 --> 18:25.310
Qu Hanshan, you...

18:26.030 --> 18:27.490
That's Chief's treasure.

18:27.830 --> 18:29.550
Does Liu Suifeng want
to keep it all for himself?

18:29.550 --> 18:31.480
Qu Hanshan, this is Chief's order!

18:32.200 --> 18:33.640
What if Liu Suifeng lied?

18:34.310 --> 18:36.440
I think you'd better hand it over to me.

18:36.550 --> 18:37.720
I'll go ask Chief.

18:38.070 --> 18:41.470
If you interrupt its feeding,
all our efforts will be wasted!

18:42.510 --> 18:43.910
If you won't hand it over,

18:43.960 --> 18:45.620
I'll have to borrow your body.

19:09.310 --> 19:10.270
Xiao Qiushui,

19:11.440 --> 19:14.680
you think your 60 years of internal energy

19:15.480 --> 19:16.920
is enough to ambush me?

19:18.920 --> 19:20.920
As expected, we both came prepared.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.720
The disguise
on our way into the valley just now

19:22.720 --> 19:24.680
was merely a show.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.280
Hiding from me

19:26.590 --> 19:28.070
isn't your style.

19:29.030 --> 19:30.230
Why don't you come out

19:30.920 --> 19:32.400
so we can talk properly?

19:33.680 --> 19:35.640
Don't you want to know

19:35.830 --> 19:37.630
where your parents' bodies are?

19:38.590 --> 19:40.250
I've treated them quite well.

19:40.550 --> 19:42.550
To preserve their bodies from decay,

19:42.550 --> 19:44.210
I've put in quite some effort.

19:45.200 --> 19:46.200
But rest assured.

19:46.550 --> 19:48.150
They're frozen quite solid.

19:48.310 --> 19:51.570
Even striking them with a sword sheath
couldn't bend them.

19:51.750 --> 19:54.960
Though the sound was rather grating.

20:08.030 --> 20:08.830
Ghost King?

20:26.240 --> 20:26.840
Tang Song,

20:27.920 --> 20:29.110
you can't defeat me.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.310
Qu Hanshan,

20:46.270 --> 20:47.200
it's you.

20:48.240 --> 20:50.900
You're clever indeed.
You guessed it in one try.

20:51.270 --> 20:54.480
I captured Ghost King, disguised him,
and placed him here,

20:54.480 --> 20:56.410
so you could kill the wrong person.

20:56.830 --> 21:00.030
You... actually worked with Xiao Qiushui.

21:00.510 --> 21:01.350
Why not?

21:02.070 --> 21:03.030
By killing you,

21:03.030 --> 21:04.790
I can monopolize the gang's authority,

21:04.790 --> 21:06.480
inherit the Death Beetle King,

21:06.480 --> 21:08.310
and control the entire martial world.

21:08.310 --> 21:11.000
This partnership suits me just fine.

22:06.270 --> 22:06.830
Song,

22:07.480 --> 22:10.200
this Death Bringer is forbidden
in Tang Sect's internal conflicts.

22:10.200 --> 22:11.130
You can't use it.

22:23.790 --> 22:24.350
Look!

22:25.270 --> 22:25.870
This is...

22:29.480 --> 22:33.000
Since the Night of Yin-Hai has begun,
it must proceed.

22:33.350 --> 22:35.310
Tang Fang has won 4 matches in a row.

22:35.480 --> 22:38.480
One more victory,
and she'll remain the first branch.

22:46.070 --> 22:47.000
Qu Hanshan,

22:47.550 --> 22:49.150
you've been deceived by him!

24:35.270 --> 24:35.960
Tang Song,

24:36.550 --> 24:37.310
you've lost.

24:38.880 --> 24:39.740
Old Madam Tang,

24:39.750 --> 24:41.750
Tang Song used evil techniques
to coerce the fifth branch.

24:41.750 --> 24:42.830
Please be clear!

24:43.830 --> 24:53.550
-Punish Tang Song severely!
-Punish Tang Song severely!

24:53.790 --> 24:55.110
He must be punished severely!

24:55.110 --> 24:57.970
Old Madam Tang,
Tang Song used gu insects to force us

24:58.030 --> 25:00.070
to make Insect Valley
the location for the Night of Yin-Hai.

25:00.070 --> 25:02.510
Then, using the 5 elders' authority
over the Avici Tower,

25:02.510 --> 25:03.640
he replaced the guards here

25:03.640 --> 25:05.350
with masked convicts.

25:08.680 --> 25:09.440
Come here.

25:23.880 --> 25:25.270
I'm Xiao Qiushui from Huanhua.

25:25.270 --> 25:26.800
Greetings, Old Madam Tang.

25:27.350 --> 25:28.830
So you're Xiao Qiushui.

25:29.960 --> 25:31.270
But any outsider who disrupts
Tang Sect's arena fight

25:31.270 --> 25:33.680
must pay with his life.

25:36.270 --> 25:37.960
Old Madam Tang, please be clear.

25:37.960 --> 25:39.720
When Tang Song used the forbidden weapon,

25:39.720 --> 25:41.160
the duel had already ended.

25:41.160 --> 25:44.480
Xiao Qiushui stepped in
to aid me at that moment,

25:44.830 --> 25:46.160
so no rules were broken.

25:46.270 --> 25:48.640
Then how did he enter Insect Valley?

25:49.720 --> 25:52.400
Fang, surely you weren't unaware, right?

25:55.400 --> 25:56.260
Old Madam Tang,

25:57.200 --> 26:00.330
entering Tang Sect's forbidden area
is indeed my fault.

26:00.400 --> 26:03.460
But Tang Sect's Tang Song
conspired with the Power Gang

26:03.750 --> 26:05.830
to use Insect Valley
to rejuvenate the gu insect.

26:05.830 --> 26:08.110
I only came to stop it.

26:08.960 --> 26:11.220
Now the Beetle King has been killed by me,

26:11.350 --> 26:14.210
and all infected Tang Sect members
have recovered.

26:14.720 --> 26:17.160
I came to help Tang Sect

26:17.550 --> 26:18.950
eliminate the traitors.

26:29.880 --> 26:30.510
Tang Song!

26:31.110 --> 26:31.830
Is that so?

26:33.830 --> 26:36.230
Since we're not dead, we're the witnesses.

26:36.400 --> 26:38.350
You'd better confess everything.

26:39.310 --> 26:40.350
I was foolish,

26:40.830 --> 26:42.240
manipulated by the Power Gang.

26:42.240 --> 26:44.640
Old Madam Tang, spare me!
Old Madam Tang, spare me!

26:44.640 --> 26:46.040
Old Madam Tang, spare me!

26:47.960 --> 26:50.440
Rare to see such a ruthless junior.

26:51.000 --> 26:52.030
What a pity.

26:52.720 --> 26:55.240
Send Tang Song
and all members of the third branch

26:55.240 --> 26:56.510
to the Avici Tower!

26:57.200 --> 26:58.830
Old Madam Tang, spare me! No!

26:58.830 --> 27:00.560
-Old Madam Tang, spare me!
-No!

27:00.880 --> 27:02.310
-Let me go!
-Old Madam Tang, spare me!

27:02.310 --> 27:04.160
Old Madam Tang! Old Madam Tang, spare me!

27:04.160 --> 27:06.440
-Old Madam Tang, please have mercy!
-Old Madam Tang!

27:06.440 --> 27:08.960
Old Madam Tang, I knew nothing about this.

27:09.200 --> 27:10.730
I was deceived by Tang Song.

27:11.070 --> 27:13.400
Please believe me. Please believe me!

27:13.640 --> 27:15.920
Please believe me! Please believe me!

27:36.550 --> 27:38.440
The Avici Tower is harsh,

27:39.240 --> 27:41.240
but you don't have to kill yourself.

27:41.720 --> 27:43.000
I'm innocent.

27:44.000 --> 27:46.060
I'd rather die to prove my innocence.

27:48.960 --> 27:52.510
If the third branch is completely gone,
things will be less lively.

27:52.510 --> 27:55.830
Send her to my courtyard to do chores.

27:56.960 --> 27:59.640
Thank you, Old Madam Tang. Thank you!

28:15.920 --> 28:17.450
The third son from Huanhua,

28:17.640 --> 28:19.030
Xiao Qiushui, right?

28:19.310 --> 28:19.790
Yes.

28:21.200 --> 28:23.440
You came to my place and caused chaos.

28:23.920 --> 28:25.110
If I just let this go,

28:25.640 --> 28:26.790
wouldn't Tang Sect

28:26.790 --> 28:28.270
lose a great deal of face?

28:29.750 --> 28:30.610
Old Madam Tang,

28:30.640 --> 28:31.480
-he...
-Fang.

28:32.110 --> 28:35.510
Bringing an outsider into Tang Sect
without permission is a grave offense too.

28:35.510 --> 28:36.110
Guards,

28:37.160 --> 28:39.420
send Tang Fang to the Avici Tower as well!

28:39.510 --> 28:39.960
Yes.

28:40.110 --> 28:40.970
Old Madam Tang,

28:41.790 --> 28:42.920
why must you do this?

28:43.160 --> 28:46.310
Earlier, when the Power Gang's demon
recognized me,

28:47.720 --> 28:50.450
you sent someone
to help me out of that situation.

28:50.830 --> 28:53.510
With Insect Valley being the location
for the Night of Yin-Hai,

28:53.510 --> 28:55.440
you knew something would go wrong,

28:55.750 --> 28:57.410
yet you didn't stop Tang Song.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.540
Those contradictory actions

28:59.920 --> 29:02.250
were deliberately planned by you, right?

29:02.590 --> 29:03.680
Why would I do that?

29:05.680 --> 29:07.540
Because you wanted to clean house

29:07.880 --> 29:09.810
without offending the Power Gang.

29:09.830 --> 29:10.920
So you used me

29:11.510 --> 29:14.110
to eliminate the wolves
that invaded your home

29:14.110 --> 29:16.480
and incidentally exposed Tang Song.

29:17.310 --> 29:18.370
If that's the case,

29:18.480 --> 29:20.480
Tang Fang didn't violate sect rules

29:20.680 --> 29:22.640
by secretly bringing me into Tang Sect.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.900
Rather, she understood your intentions

29:24.920 --> 29:26.050
and acted in advance

29:26.440 --> 29:28.030
to ease your burdens.

29:37.680 --> 29:38.750
I don't understand

29:39.070 --> 29:40.200
what you're saying.

29:40.830 --> 29:43.720
Xiao Qiushui,
you entered Tang Sect without permission.

29:43.720 --> 29:47.000
If I simply let you leave Tang Sect,

29:48.350 --> 29:50.350
I'm afraid it would break our rules.

30:07.680 --> 30:08.480
Xiao Qiushui,

30:09.110 --> 30:11.400
since you have
Tang Sect's invitation token,

30:11.400 --> 30:13.590
I will overlook today's offenses

30:14.640 --> 30:15.770
by you and Tang Fang.

30:16.680 --> 30:18.280
Since Tang Fang is innocent,

30:18.400 --> 30:20.800
the first branch remains the first branch!

30:21.110 --> 30:22.440
After such a long night,

30:22.750 --> 30:24.350
go back and rest early!

30:39.270 --> 30:41.800
Why didn't you dodge
Old Madam Tang's strike?

30:42.440 --> 30:43.110
That strike

30:43.960 --> 30:45.890
was a show for Tang Sect's members.

30:46.400 --> 30:48.660
And it was meant to establish authority.

30:48.680 --> 30:50.340
Of course I couldn't dodge it.

30:50.550 --> 30:51.480
Are you alright?

30:51.920 --> 30:52.590
I'm fine.

30:53.640 --> 30:54.680
There's no time to waste.

30:54.680 --> 30:55.880
Let's leave quickly.

31:06.510 --> 31:08.570
I painstakingly planted Sword King,

31:09.310 --> 31:11.710
and he was actually removed
just like that.

31:12.640 --> 31:14.640
I underestimated you.

31:38.000 --> 31:38.640
Master!

31:43.310 --> 31:44.720
Master, your injuries are severe.
You need rest.

31:44.720 --> 31:47.110
Don't force yourself
to use your energy again.

31:47.110 --> 31:48.910
Destroying my Death Beetle King

31:49.200 --> 31:50.730
and killing 2 kings in a row—

31:51.480 --> 31:53.830
Xiao Qiushui killed 3 birds with 1 stone.

31:54.270 --> 31:55.960
What a vicious plot.

31:56.550 --> 31:57.200
Master,

31:58.110 --> 32:00.680
should we tell Chief about this?

32:01.920 --> 32:02.650
Liu Suifeng!

32:08.070 --> 32:08.830
Liu Suifeng,

32:09.000 --> 32:10.000
don't you think you owe us

32:10.000 --> 32:11.260
an explanation today?

32:11.790 --> 32:12.450
Blade King,

32:13.110 --> 32:15.720
who gave you the nerve
to disrespect the Deputy Chief?

32:15.720 --> 32:17.680
What are you all doing here uninvited?

32:17.680 --> 32:18.740
Are you rebelling?

32:19.400 --> 32:21.600
I don't need to explain anything to you.

32:22.920 --> 32:23.830
Liu Suifeng,

32:24.310 --> 32:26.350
spare us your smooth talk.

32:26.830 --> 32:27.790
The Eight Kings were established

32:27.790 --> 32:29.480
to check your authority.

32:29.920 --> 32:31.180
The gang has its rules.

32:31.750 --> 32:34.310
Even if Chief lets you off today,

32:35.070 --> 32:37.110
we will not let this go.

32:42.270 --> 32:43.880
With the Misery Pills gone,

32:44.480 --> 32:47.240
you came to surround me
without Chief's order.

32:48.160 --> 32:50.400
Are you respecting the gang's rules?

32:51.070 --> 32:53.440
They say you never miss a step,

32:53.960 --> 32:56.760
yet you've failed repeatedly
due to Xiao Qiushui.

32:57.000 --> 32:58.240
Is your reputation

32:58.310 --> 32:59.720
undeserved?

32:59.720 --> 33:00.980
Or was it intentional?

33:01.480 --> 33:02.790
Why waste words on him?

33:03.070 --> 33:04.270
Let's just finish him

33:04.400 --> 33:06.790
before his schemes cause more trouble.

33:09.720 --> 33:11.640
Everyone, wait.

33:23.830 --> 33:24.750
I am at fault.

33:26.160 --> 33:28.090
I will accept Chief's punishment.

33:28.200 --> 33:31.920
But if anyone seeks to overstep his rank
and plot a rebellion,

33:32.830 --> 33:38.160
I still have the strength
to clean house for Chief.

33:38.350 --> 33:39.350
Who's rebelling?

33:39.550 --> 33:41.550
We are unwaveringly loyal to Chief,

33:41.720 --> 33:43.270
but toward you, it's a different matter.

33:43.270 --> 33:45.440
You overstepped boundaries,
and you're arrogant.

33:45.440 --> 33:47.830
Today, even if I die, I will punish you.

33:49.480 --> 33:51.830
This blade was made for you.

34:02.590 --> 34:04.850
-Greetings, Chief.
-Greetings, Chief.

34:07.000 --> 34:08.060
Suifeng's failure

34:08.920 --> 34:11.320
was due to Sword King's hidden disloyalty.

34:11.550 --> 34:12.760
If anyone is to blame,

34:13.280 --> 34:16.190
I should be blamed
for focusing only on my own plans.

34:17.150 --> 34:18.480
Over the past few years,

34:18.550 --> 34:21.840
I've neglected the private grudges
brewing within our gang.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.770
That has allowed others to exploit

34:24.320 --> 34:27.400
our internal conflicts to cause trouble.

34:35.110 --> 34:36.280
The Misery Pills

34:37.070 --> 34:39.870
were meant to prevent you
from killing each other.

34:40.280 --> 34:41.940
But if they breed resentment,

34:42.360 --> 34:44.920
I won't use them again.

34:46.880 --> 34:49.080
Today, regarding what I'm really up to,

34:49.920 --> 34:53.230
I do owe you all an explanation.

35:26.710 --> 35:27.400
Father,

35:28.440 --> 35:29.070
Mother,

35:30.880 --> 35:31.810
I've failed you.

35:33.510 --> 35:36.040
I still haven't been able
to rebuild Huanhua.

35:38.400 --> 35:40.730
I can't even protect the sword manual now.

35:41.150 --> 35:43.000
How can I ever rebuild Huanhua?

35:45.480 --> 35:46.960
I'm useless.

35:48.400 --> 35:49.000
Yiren.

35:50.710 --> 35:52.440
Don't blame yourself too much.

35:53.280 --> 35:53.960
Xueyu,

35:57.550 --> 35:59.680
the Nangong family came to provoke us.

36:01.760 --> 36:03.560
Although with a sword in my hand,

36:04.030 --> 36:05.400
I can do nothing.

36:05.960 --> 36:07.150
I'm so useless.

36:07.840 --> 36:11.590
Now everyone is kicking us
while we're down.

36:12.440 --> 36:15.040
I'm afraid
we can't even stay in Jindu anymore.

36:16.110 --> 36:17.190
But don't worry.

36:19.150 --> 36:20.610
Even if it costs me my life,

36:22.480 --> 36:23.920
I will protect you.

36:31.960 --> 36:32.550
Yiren,

36:33.360 --> 36:37.230
you've borne so much for the Xiao family.

36:38.110 --> 36:38.840
I

36:40.550 --> 36:42.710
also wish to rebuild Huanhua

36:45.070 --> 36:47.330
to comfort our parents' souls in heaven.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.440
I am...

36:58.630 --> 37:00.560
willing to marry Nangong Wushang.

37:06.150 --> 37:07.030
No, Xueyu.

37:08.150 --> 37:11.010
You can't marry him
for the sake of the sword manual.

37:12.070 --> 37:13.320
This is the only thing

37:15.550 --> 37:16.510
I can do now.

37:18.360 --> 37:22.030
I can never repay Father and Mother
for raising me.

37:23.000 --> 37:25.060
I am willing to marry Nangong Wushang

37:27.670 --> 37:29.870
to repay the Xiao family and our parents

37:30.920 --> 37:31.840
with my life.

38:43.550 --> 38:45.190
After all, you did take a palm strike.

38:45.190 --> 38:46.120
Don't ignore it.

38:46.230 --> 38:48.230
This medicine can help you recover.

38:49.510 --> 38:50.150
Thank you.

38:52.670 --> 38:54.000
Why aren't you sitting?

39:02.550 --> 39:03.030
Here.

39:09.840 --> 39:10.840
I already told you

39:11.400 --> 39:12.400
to rest properly,

39:12.840 --> 39:15.440
yet you insisted
on coming all the way out here.

39:17.320 --> 39:18.120
I won't go far.

39:18.800 --> 39:20.260
Don't worry, Doctor Tang.

39:26.550 --> 39:28.920
Can you stop pulling a long face
like an eggplant?

39:28.920 --> 39:30.050
I can't believe you.

39:30.480 --> 39:31.070
Big Brother.

39:31.070 --> 39:31.800
Big Brother.

39:36.920 --> 39:38.650
Seems like we came at a bad time.

39:39.280 --> 39:40.030
I'm parched.

39:48.440 --> 39:50.040
Did you put sugar in this tea?

39:50.320 --> 39:51.520
And you put a lot in it.

39:52.630 --> 39:54.090
It's making my teeth ache.

40:01.070 --> 40:01.710
Qiu,

40:02.320 --> 40:04.050
your zither looks pretty nice.

40:04.190 --> 40:06.880
How about we brothers
play a piece together?

40:13.800 --> 40:15.110
What's wrong with you?

40:15.590 --> 40:16.150
Him?

40:17.400 --> 40:19.960
Our famously charming Mr. Zuoqiu

40:20.320 --> 40:22.710
might soon be saying goodbye
to his carefree playboy days.

40:22.710 --> 40:24.170
You're reluctant, right?

40:25.360 --> 40:27.560
I thought I could outdrink Qu Mushuang.

40:27.960 --> 40:29.590
I planned to tell her after winning

40:29.590 --> 40:31.510
that it's not her younger sister I like.

40:31.510 --> 40:32.710
The one I like is her.

40:38.760 --> 40:40.160
This is too complicated.

40:40.590 --> 40:42.000
Although I practice the Joint Lock,

40:42.000 --> 40:43.230
my master once told me

40:43.440 --> 40:45.230
that the Qu family's best technique,
Spring Night,

40:45.230 --> 40:46.960
resembles the thread-twining joint lock,

40:46.960 --> 40:48.320
soft as a spring breeze entering dreams.

40:48.320 --> 40:49.480
It breaks moves quietly,

40:49.480 --> 40:51.710
and its grace is unmatched in this world.

40:51.710 --> 40:52.770
I didn't believe it

40:52.920 --> 40:55.480
until that day Qu Mushuang
drew her sword to save me.

40:55.480 --> 40:56.710
Only then did I realize

40:56.710 --> 40:58.280
that all the sword techniques
I've ever seen

40:58.280 --> 41:00.030
can't compare to those
Qu Mushuang displayed

41:00.030 --> 41:00.840
to save me.

41:03.510 --> 41:06.000
If that's the case, why don't you

41:06.320 --> 41:07.980
just tell Mushuang directly?

41:10.000 --> 41:13.670
Qu Mushuang is stubborn
and protective of those close to her.

41:14.190 --> 41:17.110
Now Qu Minmiao likes Chaoran.

41:17.550 --> 41:19.230
If Chaoran tells Qu Mushuang

41:19.230 --> 41:20.760
that she's the one he likes,

41:21.320 --> 41:22.840
I'm worried that Qu Mushuang

41:22.840 --> 41:25.100
might cut ties with Chaoran completely.

41:31.670 --> 41:32.730
Miss Tang is right.

41:33.480 --> 41:34.030
Qiu,

41:34.840 --> 41:35.760
you should

41:36.190 --> 41:38.190
say it clearly to them in the first place.

41:38.190 --> 41:39.250
Do you understand?

41:39.630 --> 41:42.030
Qiushui, I'm back!
